    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. i see what you mean about the margins. but i've also heard people saying that higher wages actually help the local economy because workers spend more at places like my shop. do you think there's any truth to that or is it mostly just theory?",
      "source": "evaluator"
